<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday, Tripti! ❤️ - With Love, Jatin</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fce4ec 0%, #f8bbd0 30%, #f48fb1 60%, #ec407a 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Floating Hearts */
        .hearts-container {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .heart {
            position: absolute;
            animation: floatUp 7s ease-in infinite;
            opacity: 0;
        }

        @keyframes floatUp {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(105vh) scale(0) rotate(0deg);
                opacity: 0;
            }
            15% {
                opacity: 0.8;
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(50vh) scale(1.3) rotate(180deg);
                opacity: 0.5;
            }
            85% {
                opacity: 0.1;
            }
            100% {
                transform: translateY(-10vh) scale(0.3) rotate(360deg);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        .sparkle-burst {
            position: fixed;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 1000;
            animation: sparkleOut 1.2s ease-out forwards;
        }

        @keyframes sparkleOut {
            0% {
                transform: scale(1) translate(0, 0);
                opacity: 1;
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(0) translate(var(--dx), var(--dy));
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        .container {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px 30px;
            animation: fadeInDown 1.5s ease;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInDown {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-40px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .hero .cake {
            font-size: 90px;
            animation: bounceCake 2s ease infinite;
            display: inline-block;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .hero .cake:active {
            transform: scale(1.3);
        }

        @keyframes bounceCake {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
            }
            25% {
                transform: translateY(-25px) rotate(-5deg);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
            }
            75% {
                transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(5deg);
            }
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.6);
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.05);
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 15px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0);
            }
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3.8em;
            color: #c2185b;
            text-shadow: 3px 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .hero .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.4em;
            color: #880e4f;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .hero .kareja-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #c2185b;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            margin-top: 15px;
            animation: pulse 2s ease infinite;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .countdown-section {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 35px 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease 0.5s both;
        }

        .countdown-section h2 {
            color: #6a1b3a;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 1.5em;
        }

        .countdown-section .meet-date {
            color: #c2185b;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .countdown-timer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .time-block {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c2185b, #880e4f);
            color: white;
            padding: 22px 18px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            min-width: 85px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.45);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        .time-block:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .time-block .number {
            font-size: 2.8em;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: block;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .time-block .label {
            font-size: 0.85em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .love-letter {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 45px 35px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease 1s both;
            border-left: 6px solid #c2185b;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .love-letter::before {
            content: '💌';
            position: absolute;
            top: -30px;
            right: -20px;
            font-size: 100px;
            opacity: 0.15;
            transform: rotate(20deg);
        }

        .love-letter h2 {
            color: #c2185b;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2em;
        }

        .love-letter .dear {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #880e4f;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .love-letter p {
            line-height: 2;
            color: #4e342e;
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }

        .love-letter .highlight {
            color: #c2185b;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .signature {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #c2185b;
            font-size: 1.3em;
        }

        .signature .kareja {
            font-size: 0.8em;
            display: block;
            color: #f06292;
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        /* Gallery with upload functionality */
        .gallery {
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease 1.5s both;
        }

        .gallery h2 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #c2185b;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 2em;
        }

        .gallery .gallery-subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: #6a1b3a;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .photos {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .photo-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 18px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            border: 3px dashed #f48fb1;
        }

        .photo-card.has-photo {
            border: 3px solid #c2185b;
        }

        .photo-card:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05) rotate(-2deg);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.35);
        }

        .photo-card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
        }

        .photo-card .upload-label {
            text-align: center;
            color: #c2185b;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            padding: 10px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .photo-card .upload-icon {
            font-size: 50px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .photo-card .photo-caption {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background: rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.9);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 8px;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            transform: translateY(100%);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .photo-card:hover .photo-caption {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .photo-card input[type="file"] {
            position: absolute;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            opacity: 0;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* Reasons Section */
        .reasons {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 40px 35px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease 2s both;
        }

        .reasons h2 {
            color: #c2185b;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 2em;
        }

        .reasons-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .reasons-list li {
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin: 12px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fce4ec, #f8bbd0);
            border-radius: 35px;
            color: #4e0040;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: default;
            border-left: 4px solid #c2185b;
        }

        .reasons-list li:hover {
            transform: translateX(12px);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8bbd0, #f48fb1);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.25);
        }

        /* Kareja Section */
        .kareja-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c2185b, #880e4f);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 35px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease 2.3s both;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.4);
        }

        .kareja-section h2 {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .kareja-section .big-kareja {
            font-size: 3.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            animation: pulse 1.5s ease infinite;
        }

        .kareja-section p {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin-top: 10px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Hug Button */
        .hug-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease 2.6s both;
        }

        .hug-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c2185b, #e91e63);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 18px 40px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.5);
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .hug-btn:hover {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #880e4f, #c2185b);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(194, 24, 91, 0.65);
        }

        .hug-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }

        .hug-message {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            color: #c2185b;
            min-height: 30px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Save Button */
        .save-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease 2.8s both;
        }

        .save-btn {
            background: #4caf50;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 14px 35px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.4);
        }

        .save-btn:hover {
            background: #388e3c;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.6);
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px 30px;
            color: #c2185b;
            font-size: 1.1em;
            animation: fadeIn 2s ease 3s both;
        }

        .confetti-overlay {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 999;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .confetti-overlay.active {
            display: block;
        }

        .confetti-piece {
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            animation: confettiFall 3s ease-in forwards;
        }

        @keyframes confettiFall {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg) scale(1);
                opacity: 1;
            }
            80% {
                opacity: 1;
            }
            100% {
                transform: translateY(105vh) rotate(720deg) scale(0.3);
                opacity: 0;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.3em;
            }
            .hero .cake {
                font-size: 60px;
            }
            .love-letter {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
            .photos {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            .time-block {
                min-width: 65px;
                padding: 15px 10px;
            }
            .time-block .number {
                font-size: 2em;
            }
            .kareja-section .big-kareja {
                font-size: 2.5em;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="hearts-container" id="heartsContainer"></div>
    <div class="confetti-overlay" id="confettiOverlay"></div>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Hero -->
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="cake" id="cakeIcon" title="Click me! 🎂">🎂</div>
            <h1>Happy Birthday, Tripti!</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">The day the world became more beautiful ✨</p>
            <div class="kareja-tag">💖 My Kareja 💖</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Countdown -->
        <div class="countdown-section">
            <h2>⏰ Counting Down To Hold You Again...</h2>
            <p class="meet-date">📅 November 21, 2026</p>
            <div class="countdown-timer" id="countdown"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Love Letter -->
        <div class="love-letter">
            <h2>💌 A Letter From My Heart</h2>
            <p class="dear">My dearest Tripti, my <span class="highlight">Kareja</span> 💕</p>
            <p>
                On this beautiful day — <span class="highlight">your birthday</span> — I find myself wishing
                I could be right there beside you, holding your hand and seeing that gorgeous smile of yours.
                But even from afar, my heart beats only for you.<br><br>

                Tripti, you are the most incredible person I've ever known. The way you light up every room,
                the kindness in your soul, the way you make even ordinary moments feel magical — that's why
                I call you my <span class="highlight">Kareja</span>. You're not just in my heart; you
                <em>are</em> my heart.<br><br>

                Every day without you makes me realize just how much you mean to me. But knowing I'll
                see you on <span class="highlight">November 21st</span> keeps me going. Until then, I'm
                sending you all my love wrapped in this little website.<br><br>

                Happy birthday, my love. May this year bring you everything your beautiful heart desires.
                I can't wait to celebrate many, many more birthdays with you.<br><br>

                <em>Tu meri duniya hai, Tripti. Meri Kareja. ❤️</em>
            </p>
            <div class="signature">
                — Yours always & forever,<br>
                <strong>Jatin</strong>
                <span class="kareja">(Your Kareja ka rakhwala 😘)</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Photo Gallery with Upload -->
        <div class="gallery">
            <h2>📸 you </h2>
            <p class="gallery-subtitle">👆 add </p>
            <div class="photos" id="photoGrid">
                <!-- Photo slots generated by JS -->
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Reasons -->
        <div class="reasons">
            <h2>💖 10 Reasons Tripti Is My Kareja</h2>
            <ul class="reasons-list">
                <li>✨ <strong>Your smile</strong> — it can brighten even my darkest days</li>
                <li>😂 <strong>Your laugh</strong> — the sweetest sound I've ever heard</li>
                <li>💪 <strong>Your strength</strong> — you inspire me every single day</li>
                <li>🌸 <strong>Your kindness</strong> — the way you care for everyone around you</li>
                <li>🧠 <strong>Your mind</strong> — I love our conversations and your perspective</li>
                <li>🎯 <strong>Your passion</strong> — you chase your dreams fearlessly</li>
                <li>🤗 <strong>Your hugs</strong> — counting days until November 21st for the next one!</li>
                <li>👀 <strong>Those eyes</strong> — I get lost in them every time</li>
                <li>🎵 <strong>Your voice</strong> — even a phone call makes my day complete</li>
                <li>❤️ <strong>Because you're YOU</strong> — Tripti, meri Kareja, there's no one like you</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Kareja Shoutout -->
        <div class="kareja-section">
            <h2>💝 A Special Message for My Kareja 💝</h2>
            <div class="big-kareja">KAREJA ❤️</div>
            <p>
                Tripti, tu sirf mera pyaar nahi, tu meri <strong>Kareja</strong> hai.<br>
                Jaan se bhi zyada pyaar karta hoon tujhe.<br>
                Happy Birthday, meri jaan! 🎂
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 15px; opacity: 0.8;">
              
